title: Police and Internal Security
subtitle: The Interior: the police, the investigation of named violence, protection, and the act of 1922 on the voivodeship self-government.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_interior.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'internal_security') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.internal_security (technical reference 16.3, 17.12.2, 17.12.6; card catalogue 8.12). Opening and
// closing the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action. The police stay an organ of the state:
// a change of government neither undoes the training nor makes them an organisation of PPS.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'internal_security');
Q.pl_police_line = PolishSecurity.policeLine(Q);
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_interior');
!}

= Police and internal security

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

[+ pl_police_line +]

An investigation concerns a known case; it does not by itself prove anyone's guilt. The execution of the act of 26 IX 1922 gives the voivodeships of Lwów, Stanisławów and Tarnopol their diets with a Polish and a Ruthenian chamber, schools in the language of the chamber and a Ruthenian university.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @professionalization
- @investigate_far_right
- @investigate_communist
- @police_protection
- @limited_autonomy
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@professionalization
title: Professionalise the police and subordinate it to lawful authorities
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit a month for three months; then command and lawful compliance improve (+10, once in the chapter).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'professionalization').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_professionalization_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'professionalization');
!}
go-to: result

@investigate_far_right
title: Investigate the named violence of the far right
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit for one month; needs a recorded case. A confirmed investigation assigns the case to a party.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_far_right').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_investigate_far_right_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_far_right');
!}
go-to: result

@investigate_communist
title: Investigate the named violence of the communists
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit for one month; needs a recorded case. A confirmed investigation assigns the case to a party.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_communist').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_investigate_communist_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'investigate_communist');
!}
go-to: result

@police_protection
title: Protect a named gathering or institution
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit for one month; the protection in this case grows this month (+10 times its execution).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'police_protection').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_police_protection_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'police_protection');
!}
go-to: result

@limited_autonomy
title: Carry out the act on the voivodeship self-government
subtitle: Needs an agreed point with the representation of the other minorities; its law goes to the Sejm now, then it costs the budget 1 unit a month for three months.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'internal_security', 'limited_autonomy').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_internal_security_limited_autonomy_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'internal_security', 'limited_autonomy');
!}
go-to: result

